    justification:  # 60f5
    description: "scripts/build-source-grammars uses git clone --depth 1 from HEAD for Lean and Wolfram grammars (line 105). No commit SHA is pinned, so shape_id values for these languages are non-reproducible across builds. Replace with git clone + git checkout <commit-sha> and track SHAs as constants in the script. See ADR-0014 Phase 0."  # 60f5
    fields:  # 60f5
      statement: "Build-from-source grammars must be pinned to specific commits for shape_id reproducibility"  # 60f5
      root_cause: "scripts/build-source-grammars clones from HEAD with no commit SHA"  # 60f5
